   "title": "变更单保存后formMode未置view致留编辑态",
   "type": "pattern",
   "content": "变更单保存成功分支未将路由formMode改为view，导致停留编辑态且提交按钮不展示。在`src/views/institution/agencyPersonnel/components/AgencyPersonnelDetail.vue`与`src/views/institution/leasePersonnel/components/LeasePersonnelDetail.vue`的`handleSave`中，通过`$router.replace`将query.formMode置为'view'，保留`changeActive`与`personnelRecordChangeId`走变更接口，并移除冗余的`loadChangeDetail`调用。",
